-  ⟨centered_reflection s,
-    logarithmicScale_centered s,
-    centeredScale_eq_riccatiField z,
-    centeredScale_eq_zero_iff z⟩
-
-end InfoGeometry.Arithmetic.RiemannApolloniusRiccatiBridge
